  "Compute detention with configurable detention policies — clock rules, tiered rates, notices, and full calculation receipts — instead of the legacy flat threshold below. Requires at least one Active detention policy or a default policy.": "以可設定的滯留費政策計算滯留費 — 包含計時規則、級距費率、通知與完整計算明細 — 取代下方的舊版固定門檻。須至少有一項啟用中的滯留費政策或預設政策。",
  "Configure and manage your shipment control settings": "設定並管理運單控制項",
  "Configure how the system automatically voids shipments that have been in the \"New\" status for more than the configured threshold based on the creation date. This helps maintain operational efficiency and ensures that shipments are not left in a \"New\" state for an extended period of time.": "設定系統如何依建立日期，自動作廢停留在「新增」狀態超過設定門檻的運單。此舉有助維持營運效率，並避免運單長時間停留在「新增」狀態。",
  "Configure how the system identifies, records, and responds to shipment delays throughout the transportation lifecycle. Automated delay detection and status updates improve operational visibility, enable proactive customer communication, and provide key data for service failure analysis. These settings determine when a shipment's status is automatically changed to \"Delayed\" and what threshold triggers escalation protocols.": "設定系統在整個運輸週期中如何辨識、記錄並回應運單延誤。自動延誤偵測與狀態更新可提升營運可見度、促成主動聯繫客戶，並為服務失誤分析提供關鍵資料。這些設定決定運單狀態於何時自動變更為「延誤」，以及何種門檻會觸發升級處理程序。",
  "Configure how the system monitors, calculates, and bills for detention time when drivers are delayed at shipping or receiving facilities beyond allowable timeframes. Proper detention tracking helps recover revenue, improve asset utilization, and provide documentation for customer negotiations.": "設定系統在駕駛員於發貨或收貨場站滯留超過允許時間時，如何監控、計算並計費滯留時間。妥善追蹤滯留有助於回收營收、提升資產運用效率，並為客戶協商提供佐證資料。",
  "Default detention policy": "預設滯留費政策",
  "Define core operational rules for shipment creation, validation, and management throughout the shipment lifecycle. These settings establish system-wide behaviors that ensure data integrity, prevent duplications, and determine permissible operations for users across all departments.": "定義運單建立、驗證與管理在整個生命週期中的核心作業規則。這些設定建立全系統行為，確保資料完整性、避免重複，並決定各部門使用者可執行的作業。",
  "Defines the number of days a shipment can be in the 'New' status before it is automatically canceled.": "定義運單在自動取消前可停留於「新增」狀態的天數。",
  "Defines the standard free time allowance (in minutes) at facilities before detention charges begin accruing.": "定義場站開始計收滯留費前的標準免費時間（分鐘）。",
  "Defines the time variance (in minutes) from scheduled delivery or transit milestones before a shipment is flagged as 'Delayed'.": "定義運單被標示為「延誤」前，相對於預定送達或運送里程碑的時間差（分鐘）。",
