  "Establish key performance indicators (KPIs) and operational targets that drive your transportation business. These metrics serve as benchmarks for evaluating carrier performance, influence performance-based compensation models, and help identify operational improvement opportunities. The targets set here will be used across dashboards, reports, and exception alerts.": "建立推動運輸業務的關鍵績效指標（KPI）與營運目標。這些指標可作為評估承運業者績效的基準、影響績效薪酬模式，並協助找出營運改善機會。此處設定的目標將用於儀表板、報表與例外警示。",
