  "Sets the upper weight limit (in pounds) for shipments created in the system. This helps ensure compliance with carrier weight restrictions and prevents data entry errors during shipment creation.": "設定系統中所建立運單的重量上限 (磅)。有助於符合承運業者的重量限制，並避免建立運單時的資料輸入錯誤。",
