  "Use detention policy engine": "使用滯留費政策引擎",
  "When enabled, the system will automatically calculate and record detention time at pickup and delivery locations based on geofence entry/exit times or driver status updates.": "啟用後，系統會依地理圍籬進出時間或駕駛員狀態更新，自動計算並記錄取貨與送貨地點的滯留時間。",
  "When enabled, the system will automatically cancel shipments that have been in the 'New' status for more than the configured threshold.": "啟用後，系統會自動取消停留在「新建」狀態超過所設門檻的運單。",
  "When enabled, the system will automatically change a shipment's status to 'Delayed' when it exceeds the configured threshold from the scheduled delivery time. This ensures consistent status reporting, eliminates manual status updates, and triggers appropriate notifications to internal staff and external stakeholders.": "啟用後，當運單超過排定送貨時間所設的門檻時，系統會自動將其狀態改為「延誤」。這可確保狀態回報一致、免除人工更新狀態，並適時通知內部人員與外部關係人。",
  "When enabled, the system will monitor and document instances where customers refuse shipments.": "啟用後，系統會監控並記錄客戶拒收運單的情形。",
  "When enabled, the system will verify that each BOL number is unique during shipment creation. This prevents accidental duplications that could lead to operational confusion, billing errors, and customer service issues. Recommended for most operations to maintain data integrity.": "啟用後，系統會在建立運單時驗證每個提單號碼的唯一性。可避免意外重複而導致營運混亂、帳務錯誤與客服問題。建議多數作業啟用，以維護資料完整性。",
  "When enabled, the system will verify that hazmat shipments are properly segregated and labeled according to DOT regulations. This ensures that hazardous materials are transported safely and in compliance with all applicable laws and regulations.": "啟用後，系統會依 DOT 法規驗證危險品運單是否已妥善隔離與標示。可確保危險品運送安全，並符合所有適用法規。",
  "When enabled, users can completely remove moves from shipments rather than canceling them. This affects shipment integrity, billing, and audit trails. Enable with caution as it allows permanent removal of shipment segments, which may impact financial reconciliation and historical reporting.": "啟用後，使用者可直接自運單中完全移除運程，而非將其取消。此設定會影響運單完整性、帳務與稽核軌跡。請審慎啟用，因為它允許永久移除運單區段，可能影響財務對帳與歷史報表。"
